	(text_box "12 V, 5 A adapter (5.5 x 2.1 mm plug, centre\npositive; ORDER_LIST.md). F1 resets itself after a\nshort: it holds 5 A and trips by 10 A. Q1 conducts\nonly when the plug is the right way round: its\nbody diode lifts the source, then the gate, pulled\nto ground by R1, turns it fully on (9.5 mOhm: 0.15\nW at 4 A). D1 keeps the gate within 10 V of the\nsource. Plugged in backwards, Q1 blocks. D2 clamps\nthe ringing of a long cable at plug-in (up to\ntwice the supply, Linear Technology AN88); C1's\nresistance damps it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.7800 82.5500 0) (size 46.9900 21.5900)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "530a22f6-a9a6-45c1-6619-66b5ee5b62c7"))
	(text "4.8 V BUCK" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 144.7800 33.0200 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0977c057-9d18-d355-a4c1-1bbee7746582"))
