	(text_box "Core regulator (1.1 V): Raspberry Pi's parts\nand layout, copied exactly\n(gen/rpi_minimal), as on GPiBridge. L2 is\npolarity-marked: its dot must sit as their\nfootprint shows." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 359.4100 134.6200 0) (size 39.3700 11.4300)
