	(text_box "3.3 V and 1.1 V: one 100 nF at every supply\npin. ADC_AVDD shares the 3.3 V: the ADC\nreads currents and a Hall sensor to 1 %, not\nmicrovolts." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 412.7500 134.6200 0) (size 40.6400 10.1600)
