	(text_box "BOOT: hold it while plugging in to start\nthe RP2354A's USB bootloader. Rarely\nneeded: 'picotool reboot -f -u' gets\nthere from software. RUN stays open: it\nhas its own pull-up inside the RP2354A,\nand the Debug Probe resets the chip over\nSWD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 251.4600 284.4800 0) (size 38.1000 15.2400)
