	(label "PEND3_IPROPI" (at 632.4600 227.3300 0) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f0eba4fe-5266-4f16-5814-a78dda4f2cd4"))
	(text_box "U8, U5-U7: DRV8874 H-bridges from 12 V.\nPMODE high: PWM mode (IN1 and IN2 drive\nthe bridge; both low: coast). IMODE to\nground: fixed off-time chopping at ITRIP\n= 3.3 V / (450 uA/A x 2.2k) = 3.3 A, so\nno coil ever carries more. IPROPI\nmirrors the low-side current, 450 uA per\namp: 2.2k makes 1 V per amp, then 1k and\n10n filter it. nSLEEP, shared, latches\nPMODE and IMODE when it rises; 4.7k\nholds the bridges asleep through a\nreset. nFAULT, shared and open-drain,\ngoes low on overcurrent, overheating or\nundervoltage." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 701.0400 58.4200 0) (size 39.3700 26.6700)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bb289182-6105-2d9e-8f95-a9f0c9828a97"))
	(text_box "U8 drives the levitation coil on the\nperch (LEV_A, LEV_B: up the right edge\nto the tree's socket). L3-L5: the\npendulum coils under the bat's swing, 12\nturns on each of 4 layers, 31 uH, 2 ohm\n(copper on this board, gen/coils.py)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 701.0400 121.9200 0) (size 36.8300 12.7000)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ee8d680a-3648-14c1-6bec-acd8b0df64ef"))
